@startuml synthetic-generation-architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "SF Pro Display"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam rectangleBorderThickness 2

' Title
title Synthetic Data Generation Architecture
caption Level 2: Workstream 8 - Controlled degradation for training augmentation

' Legend
legend right
  |= Component |= Purpose |= Color |
  | Configuration | Degradation parameters | <back:#FCE4EC>Magenta</back> |
  | Engine | Transform application | <back:#FCE4EC>Magenta</back> |
  | Integration | External workstreams | <back:#E3F2FD>Blue/Orange/Red</back> |
  | Status | ✅ Complete 🚧 In Progress | |
endlegend

' === CORE COMPONENTS ===
package "Synthetic Generation Core" <<Rectangle>> #FCE4EC {

  ' Configuration Layer
  component "Configuration Layer\n~294 lines\n✅ COMPLETE" as ConfigLayer #FCE4EC {
    component "DegradationConfig" as DegConfig {
      component "BlurConfig\nkernel_size, sigma" as BlurCfg
      component "SaltPepperConfig\namount, ratio" as SaltPepperCfg
      component "MorphologicalConfig\noperation, iterations" as MorphCfg
      component "BleedThroughConfig\nalpha, offset" as BleedCfg
    }
  }

  ' Degradation Engine
  component "Degradation Engine\n~314 lines\n🚧 GENALOG PENDING" as EngineLayer #FCE4EC {
    component "GenalogDegrader" as Degrader {
      port apply
      port apply_batch
      port generate_sensitivity
    }
    component "create_default_degrader()" as Factory
  }

  ' Benchmarking
  component "Benchmarking Integration\n~423 lines\n✅ COMPLETE" as BenchLayer #FCE4EC {
    component "SyntheticIQAAdapter" as Adapter {
      component "blur subset\n9 samples" as BlurSubset
      component "skew subset\n13 samples" as SkewSubset
      component "noise subset\n7 samples" as NoiseSubset
      component "contrast subset\n7 samples" as ContrastSubset
      component "binarization subset\n7 samples" as BinarizationSubset
    }
  }
}

' === DATA FLOW ===
storage "Clean Documents\n(300 DPI)" as CleanDocs #E0E0E0
database "Synthetic Dataset\n(with labels)" as SyntheticDB #FCE4EC
database "Benchmark Subsets\n(5 types)" as BenchmarkDB #FCE4EC

CleanDocs --> ConfigLayer : 1. Configure\nDegradation
ConfigLayer --> EngineLayer : 2. Pass Config
EngineLayer --> SyntheticDB : 3. Store\nLabeled Data
EngineLayer --> BenchLayer : 4. Generate\nBenchmarks
BenchLayer --> BenchmarkDB : 5. Save\nSubsets

' === INTEGRATION WITH OTHER WORKSTREAMS ===
package "Workstream 2: Production Model Training" <<Rectangle>> #E3F2FD {
  component "Teacher-Student\nResNet Training" as WS2Training #E3F2FD
  component "Model Validation" as WS2Validation #E3F2FD
}

package "Workstream 3: Data Preparation" <<Rectangle>> #FFF3E0 {
  component "Dataset Catalog" as WS3Catalog #FFF3E0
  component "Clean Source Images" as WS3Clean #FFF3E0
}

package "Workstream 7: Monitoring & Drift" <<Rectangle>> #FFEBEE {
  component "Drift Detection" as WS7Drift #FFEBEE
  component "Active Learning" as WS7Active #FFEBEE
}

' Integration arrows
SyntheticDB --> WS2Training : Training\nAugmentation\n(30% synthetic)
BenchmarkDB --> WS2Validation : Detector\nValidation
WS3Clean --> CleanDocs : Provide\nPristine Images
SyntheticDB --> WS3Catalog : Dataset\nExpansion
BenchmarkDB --> WS7Drift : Drift\nBaselines

' === GROUND TRUTH GENERATION ===
note right of SyntheticDB
  **Automatic Label Derivation**

  Parameters → Quality Scores:
  • blur_severity = sigma / 5.0
  • noise_severity = amount / 0.05
  • morph_severity = iterations / 3.0
  • overall_quality = 1.0 - max(...)

  **Benefits**:
  ✓ No manual annotation
  ✓ Perfect ground truth
  ✓ Scalable to millions
  ✓ **Cost Savings: $24,500 (98%)**
end note

' === WORKFLOW NOTES ===
note as WorkflowNote
  **Synthetic Generation Workflow**

  **Processing Pipeline**:
  1. Select clean source images (300 DPI)
  2. Configure degradation params
  3. Apply transformations (Genalog)
  4. Generate quality labels (automatic)
  5. Create benchmark subsets (5 types)
  6. Handoff to training/monitoring

  **Performance**:
  • Single image: 50-200ms
  • Batch (32): 2-5 sec
  • Dataset (1000 images): 10-15 min
end note

' === REPRODUCIBILITY ===
note left of ConfigLayer
  **Reproducibility & Versioning**

  **Seed Control**:
  config = DegradationConfig(seed=42, ...)
  → Bit-for-bit identical output

  **Dataset Versioning**:
  - Manifest tracking (YAML)
  - Degradation profile history
  - Genalog version pinning
  - Audit trail for training

  **Example Manifest**:
  version: "v1.0.0"
  base_images: 500
  profiles: [light_scan, heavy_scan]
  total_images: 1500
  genalog_version: "0.2.0"
  seed: 42
end note

' === TRACEABILITY ===
note as TraceSummary
